<node id="Valve V-102">
  <data key="d0">Valve V-102</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">Valve V-102 is a control valve that plays a crucial role in the Process Engineering System, enabling its further development and advancement. According to various descriptions, it is characterized as a Control Valve defined in C02.xml, emphasizing its importance within this specific framework.

