<node id="NOZZLE_SHAPE">
  <data key="d0">NOZZLE_SHAPE</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Here is the synthesized summary:

The Nozzle Shape entity represents a set of nozzle shapes defined in C01V04-VER.EX01.xml. The entity has multiple attributes that describe its characteristics, including Nominal Diameter Numerical Value Representation, Nominal Diameter Representation, Nominal Diameter Standard, and Nominal Diameter Type Representation.

These nozzle shapes have specific parameters and attributes that provide context for their use in technical applications. For example, one nozzle shape has a nominal diameter of DN 50 with ID Nozzle-5, while another has a nominal diameter of DN 80 with ID Nozzle-18. The entity also includes details such as SubTagName, which can be N1, N6, or N3.

Individual nozzles include the likes of Nozzle-11, Nozzle-14 (with attributes NominalDiameterNumericalValueRepresentation 50 and others), and Nozzle-17 with a NominalDiameterNumericalValueRepresentation of '25' and NominalDiameterTypeRepresentation = 'DN'. Nozzle-Nozzle-16 has additional attributes.&lt;SEP&gt;"Nozzle defined in C01V04-VER.EX01.xml")</data>
